{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20827","headline":"送沈亚之歌 · 李贺","name":"送沈亚之歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴兴才人怨春风，桃花满陌千里红。\n紫丝竹断騘马小，家住钱塘东复东。\n白藤交穿织书笈，短策齐裁如梵夹。\n雄光宝矿献春卿，烟底蓦波乘一叶。\n春卿拾材白日下，掷置黄金解龙马。\n携笈归江重入门，劳劳谁是怜君者。\n吾闻壮夫重心骨，古人三走无摧捽。\n请君待旦事长鞭，他日还辕及秋律。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}